+offers: []
+faq:
+  - q: "Who publishes SiftedTools?"
+    a: "SiftedTools is published by MVM Studio, a sole proprietorship (auto-entrepreneur) registered in France under SIRET 844 116 053 00035. The founder and primary author is Marvin Munos, a former sales director in mass retail and FMCG, e-commerce store operator, and author of every comparison published on the site."
+  - q: "Why was SiftedTools created?"
+    a: "Because most AI tool comparison sites for e-commerce are written by content writers who have never run a store. The criteria they evaluate don't match the real constraints of an operator. Marvin created SiftedTools to publish editorial verdicts from tests on his own stores, using the criteria a real e-commerce operator would use."
+  - q: "How does SiftedTools make money?"
+    a: "Through affiliate links to the tools we recommend. When you click one of our links and subscribe, we earn a commission at no extra cost to you. No brand can pay for a better ranking, and several tools at the top of our rankings have no affiliate program at all. Details in our methodology."
+---
+
+SiftedTools is an independent comparator of AI tools for e-commerce. Every verdict comes from real-store testing, not spec sheets. The site is published by **MVM Studio** (SIRET 844 116 053 00035), founded by **Marvin Munos**.
+
+## The operator behind the verdicts
+
+Marvin spent 15 years in French mass retail and FMCG at sales director level before building and operating his own e-commerce stores. He tests every tool he recommends on real shops, not from a product page.
+
+## Editorial independence
+
+SiftedTools earns revenue through affiliate links. This never influences rankings. Several top-ranked tools (ChatGPT, Claude) have no affiliate program at all. Our [methodology](/en/methodology/) explains how we test and rank.
+
+## The GEO Barometer
+
+We also publish the **GEO Barometer**, powered by [Quotis](https://quotis.ai), which measures which AI tools ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity actually recommend. It's an independent signal no vendor can buy.
