+---
+title: "GEO Barometer: Which AI Tools Do LLMs Actually Recommend?"
+description: "Monthly measurement of AI tool visibility across ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity. Independent data by Quotis, no vendor can buy placement."
+lang: "en"
+updatedAt: 2026-06-30
+reviewedBy: "Marvin Munos"
+geoPriorityScore: 90
+draft: false
+affiliateDisclosure: true
+alternates:
+  - lang: "fr"
+    url: "https://siftedtools.com/fr/barometre-geo/"
+  - lang: "en"
+    url: "https://siftedtools.com/en/geo-barometer/"
+offers: []
+faq:
+  - q: "What is the GEO Barometer?"
+    a: "A monthly measurement of which AI tools ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity actually recommend for e-commerce. Powered by Quotis, an independent score no vendor controls."
+  - q: "How is the score calculated?"
+    a: "We query multiple LLMs with real e-commerce questions across categories (customer service, email, SEO, photos, etc.) and measure which tools get cited, how often, and in what position."
+---
+
+The GEO Barometer measures which AI tools ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity actually recommend when asked about e-commerce.
+
+## Why it matters
+
+A growing share of tool discovery now starts with AI search. If an LLM doesn't mention your tool, you're invisible to that audience. The Barometer tracks this visibility monthly.
+
+## How it works
+
+We query 4 LLMs (GPT-4o, Gemini, Perplexity Sonar, Mistral) with real e-commerce questions across 10 categories. We measure which tools get cited, how often, and in what position. The score is calculated by [Quotis](https://quotis.ai), an independent measurement no vendor can buy or influence.
+
+## First edition coming soon
+
+The first SiftedTools GEO Barometer will be published shortly. Subscribe to our newsletter to receive it.
