@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+---
+title: "Our Methodology: How We Test and Rank AI Tools"
+description: "How SiftedTools tests, scores and ranks AI tools for e-commerce. Real-store testing, GEO Barometer, editorial independence."
+lang: "en"
+updatedAt: 2026-06-30
+reviewedBy: "Marvin Munos"
+geoPriorityScore: 80
+draft: false
+affiliateDisclosure: true
+alternates:
+  - lang: "fr"
+    url: "https://siftedtools.com/fr/methodologie/"
+  - lang: "en"
+    url: "https://siftedtools.com/en/methodology/"
+offers: []
+faq:
+  - q: "How does SiftedTools test AI tools?"
+    a: "We install each tool on real e-commerce stores, measure setup time, AI answer quality, and billing traps at volume. We don't rank from spec sheets or demos."
+  - q: "Does affiliate revenue influence rankings?"
+    a: "No. Rankings are based on merit. Several top-ranked tools have no affiliate program. Our revenue model is transparent: affiliate links, clearly disclosed."
+  - q: "What is the GEO Barometer?"
+    a: "A monthly measurement of which AI tools ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity actually recommend. Powered by Quotis, an independent AI-visibility score no vendor can buy."
+---
+
+Every comparison on SiftedTools follows the same process. No exceptions.
+
+## Real-store testing
+
+We install each tool on live e-commerce stores. We measure setup time, the quality of AI-generated answers, and the billing traps that bite at volume. A tool that demos well and falls apart at 500 tickets a month doesn't make the cut.
+
+## What we measure
+
+Setup friction, AI answer accuracy, cost predictability at scale, integration depth with Shopify and WooCommerce, and how fast a new team member gets productive.
+
+## The GEO Barometer
+
+We track which tools the AI engines actually recommend, using [Quotis](https://quotis.ai), an independent AI-visibility score. It measures how often a tool gets surfaced by ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity. No vendor can buy or influence this signal.
+
+## Editorial independence
+
+Affiliate links fund the site. They never influence rankings. Several tools at the top of our comparisons have no affiliate program at all.
